                <mxCell id="legend_current" value="&lt;b&gt;Current architecture notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• EMS Bridge is the protocol-neutral bridge.&lt;br&gt;• S2 Wrapper is the only current protocol wrapper.&lt;br&gt;• Captive Portal is separate from Ethernet/WiFi: WiFi brings up APSTA, portal owns DNS/HTTP pages.&lt;br&gt;• Modbus Mapping is request-driven; it does not periodically poll sensors." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" parent="1" vertex="1">
